#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Game screen is in the center of the screen and is the largest section of "
"the window. The background is populated with the game tiles."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Statusbar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Status bar is located at the bottom of the screen, and contains four "
"panes. The first pane lists the removed/total tiles and the number of "
"matching tiles that have free sides. The second pane gives the sequence "
"number of the game you are playing. The third pane lets the player knows "
"when the game is ready, and the last pane displayes the game timer, which "
"keeps track of theelapsed time from the start of the game until the game is "
"finished."
msgstr ""

